  "description": "This skid steer pallet fork frame is constructed from heavy-duty grade 50 steel, ensuring exceptional durability and withstanding up to 4,000 pounds of pulling force. You can confidently lift and transport heavy objects with ease.\nFitment\nThis pallet fork frame is compatible with a wide range of loaders and tractors, including popular brands such as Bobcat Skid Steer, New Holland, and Kubota tractors. It is an ideal tool for various applications in farm, factory, warehouse, and construction site work.\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nQuality Steel: YITAMOTOR skid steer pallet fork frame is made from heavy-duty grade 50 steel that can withstand up to 4,000 pounds pulling force, enabling you to effortlessly carry heavy objects\nDouble Protection: The joint use of powder coating and painted finish makes us stand out from other single finish applied alternatives; This double application grants a robust & smooth surface that has excellent rust & scratch resistance\nEasy to Use: The pallet fork frame is a quick connect skid steer that can be directly installed to the machine. The pallet fork blade can be freely moved on the skid steer frame, and the distance can be adjusted within a 17\"-37\" range on the frame; The extended top bracket reduces timber slipping risk during handling\nExtensive Compatibility: Suitable for most loaders and tractors; Compatible with Bobcat Skid Steer, New Holland and Kubota tractors; Ideal for handling most farm, factory, warehouse and construction site work\nSpecifications and Reliable Service: The pallet fork frame's total weight: 119 lbs, total length: 45.4\", total height: 38\"; The total weight of pallet forks: 198.4 lbs, length: 48\", width: 4\", height: 22\".",
